
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000


### Step 1: Smallest possible GET endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json


### Step 2: Path parameter - valid integer
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/7
Accept: application/json


### Step 3: Path parameter - invalid integer
# Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/abc
Accept: application/json


### Step 4A: Query parameter - genre specified
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?genre=Sci-Fi
Accept: application/json


### Step 4B: Query parameter - default value
# Expected: genre = Any
GET {{baseUrl}}/search
Accept: application/json


### Step 5A: POST - arbitrary JSON body
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies-raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "anything": "goes",
    "id": "not-even-a-number"
}


### Step 5B: POST - different JSON structure
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies-raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Interstellar",
    "year": 2014,
    "rating": 8.7,
    "genres": ["Sci-Fi", "Drama"]
}


### Step 5C: POST - empty JSON object
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies-raw
Content-Type: application/json

{}
